<div class="min-h-full bg-lime-100 flex flex-col items-center py-6 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="w-full max-w-md space-y-6">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-extrabold text-lime-900 text-center mb-4">家族にメンバーを招待</h1>
    <div class="w-2/3 justify-self-center text-center text-sm font-medium text-amber-800 mb-4"> 家族（グループ）に追加したいユーザーの<br>メールアドレスを入力してください </div>
  
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-md p-6 border border-amber-200">
      <div class="flex items-center mb-4">
        <span class="icon-[mdi--account-plus-outline] text-2xl text-amber-600 mr-2"></span>
        <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-amber-900">メールアドレスで追加</h2>
      </div>
      <%= form_with url: family_members_path(@family), method: :post, data: { turbo: false }, class: "space-y-6" do |f| %>
        <div class="space-y-2">
          <%= f.label :email, "追加するユーザーのメールアドレス", class: "block text-sm font-bold text-amber-800 ml-1" %>
          <%= f.email_field :email, required: true, class: "w-full p-3 bg-lime-50 border border-lime-300 rounded-xl text-lg font-medium text-lime-900 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-lime-500 focus:border-transparent outline-none transition-all placeholder:text-amber-300" %>
        </div>
        <div>
          <%= f.submit t('helpers.submit.members.create'), data: { turbo: false }, class: "w-full py-4 bg-lime-500 hover:bg-lime-600 text-white font-bold rounded-full shadow-md transition-all active:scale-95 cursor-pointer flex items-center justify-center" %>
        </div>
      <% end %>
      
      <div class="mt-4 p-4 bg-amber-50 rounded-2xl border border-amber-100">
        <div class="flex items-start">
          <span class="icon-[mdi--information-outline] text-amber-600 mr-2 mt-0.5 text-xl"></span>
          <p class="text-xs text-amber-800 leading-relaxed"> 入力したメールアドレスのユーザーがすでにアプリに登録されている場合、即座に家族に追加されます。 </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center py-4">
      <%= link_to family_path(@family), data: { turbo: false }, class: "inline-flex items-center text-lime-900 font-bold hover:text-amber-700 transition-colors" do %>
        <span class="icon-[mdi--arrow-left] mr-1"></span> <%= t('helpers.link.back_to_family_page') %>
      <% end %>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>